---
description: Relay runtime boundaries and honest integration claims
alwaysApply: true
---

Keep web/API, worker, and trusted MCP connectors separate. Read AGENTS.md.
Publish immutable configurations. Pin every run. Treat source content as untrusted data.
Enforce tool schemas and per-version allowlists in code. Do not give the model arbitrary SQL, network URLs, or writes.
Persist pauses and exact approval content. Keep stable write action IDs.
Never label fixture model output or synthetic sources as live provider success.
Never include private model reasoning, secrets, or raw files in execution traces.
Run npm test and npm run typecheck after runtime changes. Do not send invitations, book, or buy anything.
